[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":41},"en/routes/conteudo-do-cubo.tsx",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":-7,"_20":21,"_22":23,"_24":25,"_26":27},"tipo","etapa","cubo",{"_11":38,"_13":39,"_29":40},"id","primeira-camada","nome","1st layer","rascunho",false,"html","<p>Now the 3 bottom edges. Each one has yellow and the color of one face. With them in place, the yellow face is done and each side face gets its bottom row complete.</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/e8cce67494ab3722.svg\" alt=\"The goal: the bottom face all yellow, and the bottom row of each side with the face's color.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>The goal: the bottom face all yellow, and the bottom row of each side with the face&#39;s color.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h2>Find the edge and its place</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Pick an edge with yellow. The other color tells you its face: the yellow and green edge goes on the bottom, on the green face.</li>\n<li>Turn the whole Pyraminx, always with yellow on the bottom, until that face is in front. The edge&#39;s place is on the bottom, in front.</li>\n<li>Turn the top (<code>U</code>) until the edge is on top, at the back: the top edge between the left face and the right face.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Bring it down</h2>\n<p>Look at which way the edge&#39;s yellow is facing and do the algorithm for that side:</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama tira\"><ol aria-label=\"R U R'\"><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/156a1c1263287767-0.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>R</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/156a1c1263287767-1.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/156a1c1263287767-2.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>R'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/156a1c1263287767-3.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"></li></ol><figcaption>Yellow facing right: <code>R U R&#39;</code>.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama tira\"><ol aria-label=\"L' U' L\"><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/00da0ba1783dc70f-0.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>L'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/00da0ba1783dc70f-1.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>U'</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/00da0ba1783dc70f-2.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"giro\"><code>L</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></li><li><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/00da0ba1783dc70f-3.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"96\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\"></li></ol><figcaption>Yellow facing left: <code>L&#39; U&#39; L</code>.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<p>The two are mirrors of each other. The edges already on the bottom don&#39;t come apart: the algorithms always put the bottom pieces back.</p>\n<h2>If the edge is already on the bottom</h2>\n<p>If the edge is on the bottom, but flipped (with yellow on the side) or in another edge&#39;s place, take it out: hold that place in front and do <code>R U R&#39;</code>. It comes up, and you continue as above.</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/3b4ecbe492b59555.svg\" alt=\"In place, but flipped: the yellow in front. `R U R'` takes the edge out, and then it's as above.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>In place, but flipped: the yellow in front. <code>R U R&#39;</code> takes the edge out, and then it&#39;s as above.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<p>Do the same with the other two edges. With all 3 on the bottom, only the top layer is left.</p>\n","treino","metodos",[33],"anterior",{"_13":31,"_29":32},"proximo",{"_13":28,"_29":30},"grupos",[],"Last layer","endereco","/pyraminx/ultima-camada","Tips and centers","/pyraminx/pontas-e-centros",{"_13":34,"_35":36,"_29":37},"Top-first","numero",2,"/pyraminx/top-first#primeira-camada","pyraminx","Pyraminx","/pyraminx/",{"_42":43,"_44":45},"cubos",[48,49,50,51,52,53],"idiomas",[46,47],"pt","en",{"_11":59,"_13":59},{"_11":58,"_13":58},{"_11":57,"_13":57},{"_11":56,"_13":56},{"_11":54,"_13":55},{"_11":38,"_13":39},"megaminx","Megaminx","5x5","4x4","2x2","3x3"]
